1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,008
Bugungi videoda nima haqida? Ertaga dam olish uchun ruxsat so'rash usuli.

2
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:11,508
1-Sahna: Salomlashish va joy tasdiqlash / Asosiy yaponcha salomlashish va joy tasdiqlash

3
00:00:11,508 --> 00:00:13,474
Kechirasiz.

4
00:00:13,497 --> 00:00:14,542
Ha.

5
00:00:14,566 --> 00:00:17,099
Bu joy bo‘shmi?

6
00:00:17,122 --> 00:00:18,922
Ha, bo‘sh.

7
00:00:18,945 --> 00:00:21,545
O‘tirib olsam bo‘ladimi?

8
00:00:21,568 --> 00:00:22,935
Albatta.

9
00:00:22,958 --> 00:00:24,811
Rahmat.

10
00:00:24,835 --> 00:00:26,635
Arzimaydi.

11
00:00:26,658 --> 00:00:28,891
Yuklaringiz anchagina ko‘p ekan.

12
00:00:28,914 --> 00:00:30,720
Kechirasiz.

13
00:00:30,744 --> 00:00:32,744
Muammo yo‘q.

14
00:00:32,766 --> 00:00:35,460
Biroz surayapman.

15
00:00:35,484 --> 00:00:37,017
Kechirasiz.

16
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:38,773
Yo‘q, yo‘q.

17
00:00:38,796 --> 00:00:40,286
Sayohatmisiz?

18
00:00:40,309 --> 00:00:41,686
Ha.

19
00:00:41,710 --> 00:00:43,876
Qayerga ketmoqchisiz?

20
00:00:43,899 --> 00:00:45,899
Tokyoga boraman.

21
00:00:45,922 --> 00:00:47,557
Yaxshi ekan.

22
00:00:47,580 --> 00:00:49,059
Ha.

23
00:00:49,083 --> 00:00:50,816
Sayohat uchunmi?

24
00:00:50,839 --> 00:00:52,486
Ha, shunday.

25
00:00:52,510 --> 00:00:55,114
Men ish uchun boraman.

26
00:00:55,138 --> 00:00:56,998
Mehnatingiz uchun rahmat.

27
00:00:57,021 --> 00:00:58,754
Rahmat.

28
00:00:58,777 --> 00:01:01,178
Necha kun bo‘lasiz?

29
00:01:01,201 --> 00:01:02,968
Uch kun.

30
00:01:02,992 --> 00:01:04,838
Uzoq ekan.

31
00:01:04,861 --> 00:01:06,228
Albatta.

32
00:01:06,251 --> 00:01:08,738
Ehtiyot bo‘ling.

33
00:01:08,762 --> 00:01:17,771
Bugungi videoning ssenariysi tavsif qismidan va eng yuqori kommentdan yuklab olishingiz mumkin. Yuklab olishdan oldin iltimos, komment qoldiring.

34
00:01:17,771 --> 00:01:19,271
2-Sahna: Salomlashish va gilos gullarini suratga olish / Salomlashish va gilos gullarini suratga olish

35
00:01:19,271 --> 00:01:21,404
Kechirasiz.

36
00:01:21,427 --> 00:01:22,904
Ha.

37
00:01:22,927 --> 00:01:25,861
Suratga olishga ruxsat berasizmi?

38
00:01:25,884 --> 00:01:28,017
Shu yerda?

39
00:01:28,040 --> 00:01:29,814
Ha.

40
00:01:29,838 --> 00:01:31,916
Albatta.

41
00:01:31,939 --> 00:01:34,183
Rahmat.

42
00:01:34,207 --> 00:01:36,862
Nima suratga olmoqchisiz?

43
00:01:36,885 --> 00:01:39,419
Ana o‘sha gullarni.

44
00:01:39,442 --> 00:01:41,661
Chiroyli ekan.

45
00:01:41,684 --> 00:01:43,660
Albatta.

46
00:01:43,683 --> 00:01:45,916
Gilos gullarimi?

47
00:01:45,939 --> 00:01:48,075
Ha, shunday.

48
00:01:48,099 --> 00:01:50,667
Allaqachon gullab yotibdi.

49
00:01:50,690 --> 00:01:53,548
Havo iliq bo‘lgani uchun.

50
00:01:53,572 --> 00:01:55,658
Shunday.

51
00:01:55,681 --> 00:01:58,448
Har yili bu yerga kelaman.

52
00:01:58,471 --> 00:02:00,837
Rostdanmi?

53
00:02:00,860 --> 00:02:02,506
Ha.

54
00:02:02,529 --> 00:02:05,330
Men birinchi marta kelyapman.

55
00:02:05,354 --> 00:02:08,043
Juda yaxshi joy ekan.

56
00:02:08,066 --> 00:02:10,699
Suratlarni ko‘rsatib bering.

57
00:02:10,722 --> 00:02:13,089
Albatta.

58
00:02:13,112 --> 00:02:15,512
Ajoyib chiqibdi!

59
00:02:15,535 --> 00:02:18,302
Kamerangiz zo‘r ekan.

60
00:02:18,325 --> 00:02:20,760
Professionaldek.

61
00:02:20,783 --> 00:02:23,358
Hech ham emas.

62
00:02:23,382 --> 00:02:26,868
Menga ham kamera kerak.

63
00:02:26,891 --> 00:02:29,091
Qiziqarli bo‘ladi.

64
00:02:29,114 --> 00:02:31,581
Qidirib ko‘raman.

65
00:02:31,604 --> 00:02:38,709
Bugungi videodagi ma'lumotlarni takrorlash uchun sayt havolasini tavsif qismida va eng yuqori kommentarda topishingiz mumkin. *Sayt oldindan ogohlantirmasdan o'chirilishi mumkin.

66
00:02:38,709 --> 00:02:40,209
3-Sahna: ruchkani qarzga olish / Ruchka qarz olish

67
00:02:40,209 --> 00:02:41,776
Aytgin-chi?

68
00:02:41,799 --> 00:02:42,936
Nima?

69
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:46,213
Ruchkani bir oz qarzga olsam bo‘ladimi?

70
00:02:46,237 --> 00:02:47,570
Albatta.

71
00:02:47,593 --> 00:02:49,004
Rahmat.

72
00:02:49,027 --> 00:02:51,436
Qizil va qora rangda bor.

73
00:02:51,460 --> 00:02:53,260
Qorani bersang.

74
00:02:53,284 --> 00:02:54,684
Ha.

75
00:02:54,707 --> 00:02:56,521
Katta yordam berding.

76
00:02:56,544 --> 00:02:58,378
Nima yozmoqchisiz?

77
00:02:58,401 --> 00:03:00,251
Eslatma.

78
00:03:00,274 --> 00:03:01,849
Shundaymi?

79
00:03:01,872 --> 00:03:04,306
Telefon raqamini yozaman.

80
00:03:04,329 --> 00:03:06,583
Kimning telefon raqami?

81
00:03:06,607 --> 00:03:08,540
Do‘stimniki.

82
00:03:08,563 --> 00:03:10,050
U bilan uchrashasanmi?

83
00:03:10,074 --> 00:03:11,248
Ha.

84
00:03:11,271 --> 00:03:13,008
Qachon uchrashasiz?

85
00:03:13,032 --> 00:03:14,799
Ertaga.

86
00:03:14,822 --> 00:03:16,099
Qayerda?

87
00:03:16,122 --> 00:03:18,357
Bekat oldida.

88
00:03:18,380 --> 00:03:19,863
Yaxshi.

89
00:03:19,887 --> 00:03:22,020
Kino ko‘ramiz.

90
00:03:22,043 --> 00:03:23,678
Qaysi kino?

91
00:03:23,701 --> 00:03:25,901
Anime.

92
00:03:25,924 --> 00:03:28,124
Qiziqarli ko‘rinadi.

93
00:03:28,147 --> 00:03:30,616
Uzoq vaqtdan beri ko‘rmoqchi edim.

94
00:03:30,640 --> 00:03:32,607
Yaxshi o‘ynab kel.

95
00:03:32,630 --> 00:03:34,468
Ruchkani qaytaraman.

96
00:03:34,492 --> 00:03:36,125
Rahmat.

97
00:03:36,148 --> 00:03:37,648
4-Sahna: Tish og‘rig‘i va ishdan erta chiqish / Tish og‘rishi va ishdan erta ketish

98
00:03:37,648 --> 00:03:39,281
Kechagi boshliq.

99
00:03:39,304 --> 00:03:40,744
Ha.

100
00:03:40,768 --> 00:03:42,809
Mehnatingiz uchun rahmat.

101
00:03:42,832 --> 00:03:44,972
Xayrli kun.

102
00:03:44,995 --> 00:03:49,795
Bugun biroz erta chiqib ketishim mumkinmi?

103
00:03:49,818 --> 00:03:52,113
Nima bo‘ldi?

104
00:03:52,137 --> 00:03:54,418
Shifoxonaga borishim kerak.

105
00:03:54,441 --> 00:03:57,696
Sizga salomatlik bilan bog‘liq muammo bormi?

106
00:03:57,719 --> 00:04:00,600
Yo‘q, tish shifokori.

107
00:04:00,624 --> 00:04:03,590
Tishingiz og‘riyaptimi?

108
00:04:03,613 --> 00:04:04,901
Ha.

109
00:04:04,924 --> 00:04:08,291
Bu juda yomon.

110
00:04:08,314 --> 00:04:09,748
Kechirasiz.

111
00:04:09,771 --> 00:04:12,905
Nechanchi soatda ketasiz?

112
00:04:12,929 --> 00:04:14,929
Uchda ketishim mumkinmi?

113
00:04:14,952 --> 00:04:17,407
Albatta.

114
00:04:17,430 --> 00:04:19,430
Rahmat.

115
00:04:19,453 --> 00:04:22,537
Ishingiz tugadimi?

116
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:24,008
Ha.

117
00:04:24,032 --> 00:04:26,965
Hujjatlar ham tayyorlandi mi?

118
00:04:26,988 --> 00:04:29,588
Stol ustida turibdi.

119
00:04:29,611 --> 00:04:31,745
Tushunarli.

120
00:04:31,768 --> 00:04:34,601
Ertaga odatdagidek kelaman.

121
00:04:34,624 --> 00:04:36,758
Zo‘r bo‘lma.

122
00:04:36,781 --> 00:04:39,348
Rahmat.

123
00:04:39,371 --> 00:04:41,204
Tezroq sog‘aying.

124
00:04:41,227 --> 00:04:43,394
Kechirasiz.

125
00:04:43,417 --> 00:04:45,383
Xayrli kun.

126
00:04:45,406 --> 00:04:46,906
Sahna 5: Suhbatda haroratni sozlash / Suhbatda haroratni sozlash

127
00:04:46,906 --> 00:04:48,640
Aytgin-chi?

128
00:04:48,663 --> 00:04:49,996
Ha.

129
00:04:50,019 --> 00:04:53,263
Konditsionerni pasaytirsam bo‘ladimi?

130
00:04:53,286 --> 00:04:55,297
Sovuqmi?

131
00:04:55,321 --> 00:04:58,254
Biroz sovuqdek.

132
00:04:58,277 --> 00:04:59,882
Albatta.

133
00:04:59,905 --> 00:05:01,472
Rahmat.

134
00:05:01,495 --> 00:05:04,307
Pult u yerda.

135
00:05:04,330 --> 00:05:06,145
Ma’lum.

136
00:05:06,168 --> 00:05:08,002
Necha gradus qilib qo‘yasiz?

137
00:05:08,025 --> 00:05:10,858
Yigirma olti gradus bo‘lsa yaxshi.

138
00:05:10,881 --> 00:05:12,414
Albatta.

139
00:05:12,437 --> 00:05:15,209
Shamolni ham pasaytiraman.

140
00:05:15,233 --> 00:05:16,730
Ma’lum.

141
00:05:16,753 --> 00:05:18,572
Kechirasiz.

142
00:05:18,595 --> 00:05:21,129
Hech qisi yo‘q.

143
00:05:21,152 --> 00:05:23,435
Tashqarisi issiq ekan-ku.

144
00:05:23,459 --> 00:05:26,031
Juda issiq.

145
00:05:26,054 --> 00:05:28,723
Yoz chunki.

146
00:05:28,746 --> 00:05:29,961
Ha.

147
00:05:29,985 --> 00:05:32,027
Muzqaymoq yeysanmi?

148
00:05:32,051 --> 00:05:33,830
Yeyman.

149
00:05:33,853 --> 00:05:36,187
Muzlatgichda bor.

150
00:05:36,210 --> 00:05:37,826
Olib kelaman.

151
00:05:37,849 --> 00:05:39,334
Iltimos.

152
00:05:39,357 --> 00:05:41,091
Shokolad bo‘lsa bo‘ladi?

153
00:05:41,114 --> 00:05:42,780
Ha.

154
00:05:42,803 --> 00:05:44,672
Mana, oling.

155
00:05:44,696 --> 00:05:46,163
Rahmat.

156
00:05:46,186 --> 00:05:48,586
Mazali ekan-ku.

157
00:05:48,608 --> 00:05:50,108
Sahna 6: Kiyimni sinab ko‘rish suhbati / Kiyimni sinab ko‘rish suhbati

158
00:05:50,108 --> 00:05:52,042
Kechirasiz.

159
00:05:52,065 --> 00:05:53,265
Ha.

160
00:05:53,288 --> 00:05:56,821
Bu kiyimni sinab ko‘rsam bo‘ladimi?

161
00:05:56,844 --> 00:05:58,977
Albatta.

162
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:00,767
Qayerda?

163
00:06:00,790 --> 00:06:03,190
Ana u yerda.

164
00:06:03,213 --> 00:06:05,213
Rahmat.

165
00:06:05,236 --> 00:06:08,049
O‘lchami qanday?

166
00:06:08,073 --> 00:06:11,139
Biroz katta.

167
00:06:11,162 --> 00:06:14,008
Kichik o‘lchamini olib kelaman.

168
00:06:14,032 --> 00:06:16,087
Iltimos.

169
00:06:16,110 --> 00:06:18,076
Kutib turgizdim.

170
00:06:18,099 --> 00:06:19,899
Rahmat.

171
00:06:19,922 --> 00:06:21,756
Qanday?

172
00:06:21,779 --> 00:06:24,425
Aynan mos keldi.

173
00:06:24,448 --> 00:06:26,482
Yaxshi bo‘ldi.

174
00:06:26,505 --> 00:06:29,796
Boshqa rangi bormi?

175
00:06:29,820 --> 00:06:32,511
Qora va oq ranglari bor.

176
00:06:32,534 --> 00:06:35,101
Qorani ko‘rsating.

177
00:06:35,124 --> 00:06:37,378
Ma’lum.

178
00:06:37,401 --> 00:06:40,212
Qaysi biri yaxshi?

179
00:06:40,236 --> 00:06:43,644
Sizga qora rang ko‘proq yarashadi.

180
00:06:43,668 --> 00:06:45,635
Shundaymi?

181
00:06:45,658 --> 00:06:47,191
Ha.

182
00:06:47,214 --> 00:06:50,024
Unda, qorani olaman.

183
00:06:50,047 --> 00:06:51,814
Rahmat.

184
00:06:51,837 --> 00:06:54,890
Kredit karta ishlatish mumkinmi?

185
00:06:54,914 --> 00:06:56,480
Ha.

186
00:06:56,503 --> 00:06:58,137
Iltimos.

187
00:06:58,160 --> 00:07:00,760
Ma’lum.

188
00:07:00,783 --> 00:07:02,283
Sahna 7: Hujjatni tekshirish suhbati / Hujjatni birgalikda tekshirish

189
00:07:02,283 --> 00:07:04,449
Aniq.

190
00:07:04,472 --> 00:07:05,606
Ha.

191
00:07:05,629 --> 00:07:09,195
O‘sha hujjatni ko‘rsatsangiz bo‘ladimi?

192
00:07:09,218 --> 00:07:11,385
Bu-ku?

193
00:07:11,408 --> 00:07:13,241
Ha.

194
00:07:13,264 --> 00:07:15,031
Mana, iltimos.

195
00:07:15,054 --> 00:07:16,667
Rahmat.

196
00:07:16,691 --> 00:07:19,626
Qiyin, shunday emasmi?

197
00:07:19,649 --> 00:07:22,449
Juda qiyin.

198
00:07:22,472 --> 00:07:25,159
Nima tushunmayapsiz?

199
00:07:25,183 --> 00:07:27,783
Bu raqam.

200
00:07:27,806 --> 00:07:30,572
Aa, shu narsa.

201
00:07:30,595 --> 00:07:33,003
Xato emasmi?

202
00:07:33,027 --> 00:07:35,594
Tekshirib chiqay.

203
00:07:35,617 --> 00:07:37,284
Iltimos.

204
00:07:37,306 --> 00:07:39,706
Rostdan ham.

205
00:07:39,729 --> 00:07:43,704
Albatta, mening xatolim.

206
00:07:43,728 --> 00:07:46,094
Tuzatib qoʻying, iltimos.

207
00:07:46,117 --> 00:07:47,524
Ha.

208
00:07:47,548 --> 00:07:50,681
Yigʻilish soat uchdan.

209
00:07:50,704 --> 00:07:52,671
Yetib borishga harakat qilaman.

210
00:07:52,694 --> 00:07:55,364
Nusxa ham olib qoʻying, iltimos.

211
00:07:55,387 --> 00:07:57,164
Necha nusxa kerak?

212
00:07:57,188 --> 00:07:59,456
Oʻn nusxa.

213
00:07:59,479 --> 00:08:01,082
Tushunarli.

214
00:08:01,106 --> 00:08:03,339
Ishonib topshirdim.

215
00:08:03,362 --> 00:08:04,896
Ha.

216
00:08:04,919 --> 00:08:06,375
Marhamat.

217
00:08:06,398 --> 00:08:08,864
Hozir bajaraman.

218
00:08:08,887 --> 00:08:10,387
Sahna 8: Dam olish uchun arizalar / Dam olish soʻrovi

219
00:08:10,387 --> 00:08:12,075
Kechagi boshliq.

220
00:08:12,099 --> 00:08:13,533
Ha.

221
00:08:13,556 --> 00:08:17,089
Hozir vaqtiniz bormi?

222
00:08:17,112 --> 00:08:18,969
Nima boʻldi?

223
00:08:18,993 --> 00:08:23,826
Ertaga dam olishim mumkinmi?

224
00:08:23,849 --> 00:08:25,583
Ertaga desa.

225
00:08:25,606 --> 00:08:27,103
Ha.

226
00:08:27,126 --> 00:08:29,359
Nima boʻldi?

227
00:08:29,382 --> 00:08:32,235
Oilam aʼzosida isitma chiqdi.

228
00:08:32,258 --> 00:08:34,992
Bu xavotirli ekan.

229
00:08:35,015 --> 00:08:38,348
Shifoxonaga olib borishim kerak.

230
00:08:38,371 --> 00:08:40,038
Tushunarli.

231
00:08:40,061 --> 00:08:42,337
Kechirasiz.

232
00:08:42,360 --> 00:08:44,694
Xavotir olmang.

233
00:08:44,717 --> 00:08:46,717
Rahmat.

234
00:08:46,740 --> 00:08:49,997
Ishni topshirish kerakmi?

235
00:08:50,021 --> 00:08:53,026
Tanaka-sanga topshirdim.

236
00:08:53,049 --> 00:08:54,928
Tushunarli.

237
00:08:54,951 --> 00:08:57,318
Xatlarni ham tekshirib chiqaman.

238
00:08:57,341 --> 00:08:59,821
Zoʻrlamang.

239
00:08:59,845 --> 00:09:01,678
Kechirasiz.

240
00:09:01,701 --> 00:09:03,435
Tezroq sog‘aying.

241
00:09:03,458 --> 00:09:04,917
Ha.

242
00:09:04,940 --> 00:09:07,674
Indinga kelishingiz mumkinmi?

243
00:09:07,697 --> 00:09:09,030
Ha.

244
00:09:09,053 --> 00:09:10,932
Tushunarli.

245
00:09:10,955 --> 00:09:13,236
Iltimos, yordamingizga muhtojman.

246
00:09:13,259 --> 00:09:14,693
Ha.

247
00:09:14,716 --> 00:09:16,404
Kechirasiz.

248
00:09:16,428 --> 00:09:17,861
Xayrli kun.

249
00:09:17,884 --> 00:09:19,384
Sahna 9: Suhbat orqali yapon tilini oʻrganish / Suhbatlar orqali yapon tilini oʻrganish

250
00:09:19,384 --> 00:09:21,274
Aytgin-chi?

251
00:09:21,298 --> 00:09:22,300
Nima?

252
00:09:22,323 --> 00:09:26,018
Zaryadlovchi ishlatsam boʻladi?

253
00:09:26,042 --> 00:09:28,008
Smartfonningmi?

254
00:09:28,031 --> 00:09:29,720
Ha.

255
00:09:29,744 --> 00:09:31,555
Albatta.

256
00:09:31,578 --> 00:09:33,312
Rahmat.

257
00:09:33,335 --> 00:09:35,308
Batareyasi yoʻq.

258
00:09:35,331 --> 00:09:38,780
Faqat bir foiz qoldi.

259
00:09:38,803 --> 00:09:41,003
Xavfli ekan-ku.

260
00:09:41,026 --> 00:09:44,236
Uzoq vaqt oʻyin oʻynab oʻtirganimdan.

261
00:09:44,260 --> 00:09:46,027
Qaysi oʻyin?

262
00:09:46,050 --> 00:09:48,683
Puzzle oʻyini.

263
00:09:48,706 --> 00:09:50,706
Qiziqarli.

264
00:09:50,729 --> 00:09:53,415
Juda qiziqarli.

265
00:09:53,439 --> 00:09:55,537
Keyinroq oʻrgat.

266
00:09:55,561 --> 00:09:57,531
Albatta.

267
00:09:57,554 --> 00:10:00,407
Kabel shu yerda.

268
00:10:00,430 --> 00:10:02,007
Yetib bormadi.

269
00:10:02,031 --> 00:10:04,398
Bu yerga kel.

270
00:10:04,421 --> 00:10:05,902
Ha.

271
00:10:05,925 --> 00:10:07,359
Qoʻydim.

272
00:10:07,382 --> 00:10:09,589
Qoʻydim-ku.

273
00:10:09,612 --> 00:10:11,298
Yaxshi boʻldi.

274
00:10:11,321 --> 00:10:13,288
Qutqardingiz.

275
00:10:13,312 --> 00:10:15,645
Arzimaydi.

276
00:10:15,668 --> 00:10:18,234
Tugatib qoʻyib, qaytaraman.

277
00:10:18,257 --> 00:10:20,341
Sekinroq qilsang ham boʻladi.

278
00:10:20,365 --> 00:10:22,332
Juda mehribon ekansiz.

279
00:10:22,355 --> 00:10:24,688
Oddiygina.

280
00:10:24,711 --> 00:10:26,211
10-SAHNA: Salomlashish va itni tanishtirish

281
00:10:26,211 --> 00:10:28,378
Vov!

282
00:10:28,401 --> 00:10:30,047
Salom.

283
00:10:30,071 --> 00:10:31,926
Salom.

284
00:10:31,950 --> 00:10:34,554
Ob-havo juda yaxshi ekan-ku.

285
00:10:34,577 --> 00:10:36,673
Ha.

286
00:10:36,697 --> 00:10:40,830
Itchani silash mumkinmi?

287
00:10:40,853 --> 00:10:43,387
Muammo yo‘q.

288
00:10:43,410 --> 00:10:45,643
Rahmat.

289
00:10:45,666 --> 00:10:48,999
Tishlamaydi, xavotir olmang.

290
00:10:49,022 --> 00:10:51,756
Juda ham yoqimli ekan.

291
00:10:51,780 --> 00:10:53,752
Rahmat.

292
00:10:53,776 --> 00:10:56,142
Necha yoshda?

293
00:10:56,165 --> 00:10:58,419
Uch yoshda.

294
00:10:58,443 --> 00:11:00,576
Erkakmi?

295
00:11:00,599 --> 00:11:02,818
Qizaloq.

296
00:11:02,841 --> 00:11:05,408
Ismi nima?

297
00:11:05,431 --> 00:11:07,264
Momo.

298
00:11:07,287 --> 00:11:09,454
Momochka degani?

299
00:11:09,477 --> 00:11:11,046
Ha.

300
00:11:11,069 --> 00:11:13,703
Juni juda yumshoq ekan.

301
00:11:13,726 --> 00:11:16,945
Kecha yuvgandim.

302
00:11:16,968 --> 00:11:19,535
Juda yaxshi hid kelmoqda.

303
00:11:19,558 --> 00:11:22,332
Shampunni almashtirdim.

304
00:11:22,356 --> 00:11:25,038
Juda ham itoatkor ekan.

305
00:11:25,062 --> 00:11:27,662
Odamlarni yaxshi koʻradi.

306
00:11:27,685 --> 00:11:30,327
Dumini qimirlatib turibdi.

307
00:11:30,350 --> 00:11:32,717
Hursand boʻlsa kerak.

308
00:11:32,740 --> 00:11:35,196
Tinchlantiradi.

309
00:11:35,220 --> 00:11:37,087
Yaxshi boʻldi.

310
00:11:37,110 --> 00:11:39,043
Rahmat.

311
00:11:39,066 --> 00:11:41,667
Yoʻq, yana keling.

312
00:11:51,698 --> 00:11:53,198
11-SAHNA: Yoz suhbati

313
00:11:53,198 --> 00:11:55,565
Issiq ekan-ku.

314
00:11:55,588 --> 00:11:58,231
Issiq ekan.

315
00:11:58,255 --> 00:12:01,945
Derazani ochsam boʻladi-mi?

316
00:12:01,968 --> 00:12:03,983
Albatta.

317
00:12:04,007 --> 00:12:05,640
Rahmat.

318
00:12:05,663 --> 00:12:08,530
Shamol esayapti.

319
00:12:08,553 --> 00:12:10,953
Juda yoqimli.

320
00:12:10,976 --> 00:12:12,858
Shunday.

321
00:12:12,881 --> 00:12:16,419
Konditsionerni yoqmasak ham boʻladi.

322
00:12:16,443 --> 00:12:19,290
Hali chidaymiz.

323
00:12:19,313 --> 00:12:22,446
Tez orada yoz boʻladi.

324
00:12:22,469 --> 00:12:24,722
Yomon ekan.

325
00:12:24,746 --> 00:12:27,997
Issiqni yoqtirmaysizmi?

326
00:12:28,020 --> 00:12:30,358
Juda ham yoqtirmayman.

327
00:12:30,381 --> 00:12:33,348
Men esa yoqadi.

328
00:12:33,371 --> 00:12:35,371
Dengizga borasizmi?

329
00:12:35,394 --> 00:12:37,794
Koʻp boraman.

330
00:12:37,817 --> 00:12:39,417
Yaxshi ekan.

331
00:12:39,440 --> 00:12:42,040
Bu yil ham boraman.

332
00:12:42,063 --> 00:12:44,597
Qayerga borasiz?

333
00:12:44,619 --> 00:12:46,153
Okinava.

334
00:12:46,176 --> 00:12:48,642
Hasad qilaman!

335
00:12:48,665 --> 00:12:50,540
Birga boramizmi?

336
00:12:50,564 --> 00:12:53,457
Dam olishim yoʻq.

337
00:12:53,480 --> 00:12:55,352
Afsus.

338
00:12:55,376 --> 00:12:56,976
Ha.

339
00:12:56,999 --> 00:12:59,199
Sovgʻa olib kelaman.

340
00:12:59,222 --> 00:13:01,036
Rahmat.

341
00:13:01,059 --> 00:13:03,659
Kutib turyapman!

342
00:13:03,682 --> 00:13:05,216
Ha.

343
00:13:05,239 --> 00:13:06,739
12-SAHNA: BUYURTMA SUHBATI / Buyurtma qilish

344
00:13:06,739 --> 00:13:09,705
Hali kelmadi-ku.

345
00:13:09,728 --> 00:13:11,862
Kechikmoqda.

346
00:13:11,885 --> 00:13:15,485
Oldindan buyurtma berib qoʻysam boʻladi-mi?

347
00:13:15,508 --> 00:13:17,741
Shunday qilamiz.

348
00:13:17,764 --> 00:13:19,967
Kechirasiz.

349
00:13:19,990 --> 00:13:22,806
Ofitsiant keldi-ku.

350
00:13:22,830 --> 00:13:25,067
Buyurtma beraylik.

351
00:13:25,090 --> 00:13:26,667
Ha.

352
00:13:26,690 --> 00:13:28,532
Nima ichasan?

353
00:13:28,555 --> 00:13:31,610
Men ulung choy ichaman.

354
00:13:31,634 --> 00:13:35,933
Unda, pivo bitta va ulung choy bitta.

355
00:13:35,956 --> 00:13:38,031
Rahmat.

356
00:13:38,054 --> 00:13:40,626
Taomga nima buyurtma beramiz?

357
00:13:40,650 --> 00:13:43,528
Edamame olamiz.

358
00:13:43,552 --> 00:13:47,726
Edamame va tovuq qovurma ham.

359
00:13:47,749 --> 00:13:49,916
Salat ham xohlayman.

360
00:13:49,939 --> 00:13:52,139
Sezar salat boʻladimi?

361
00:13:52,162 --> 00:13:53,929
Ha.

362
00:13:53,952 --> 00:13:57,952
Yana, yakitori assortisi ham.

363
00:13:57,975 --> 00:14:00,231
Shu yetarli boʻladi.

364
00:14:00,254 --> 00:14:02,730
Shu bilan yetamiz.

365
00:14:02,754 --> 00:14:06,187
Tanaka kechikmoqda-ku.

366
00:14:06,210 --> 00:14:09,049
Qoʻngʻiroq qilib koʻraymi?

367
00:14:09,073 --> 00:14:10,673
Shunday.

368
00:14:10,696 --> 00:14:13,374
A, kelayotganga oʻxshaydi.

369
00:14:13,397 --> 00:14:15,397
Rostdan ham.

370
00:14:15,420 --> 00:14:17,787
Xayrli kun.

371
00:14:17,810 --> 00:14:19,976
Bu yerda!

372
00:14:19,999 --> 00:14:22,599
Oldindan buyurtma berib qoʻydik.

373
00:14:22,622 --> 00:14:24,875
Qoʻshimcha buyurtma beramiz.

374
00:14:24,899 --> 00:14:26,399
13-SAHNA: YIGʻILISH TAYYORLASH / Yigʻilish uchun tayyorlanish

375
00:14:26,399 --> 00:14:29,041
Aniq.

376
00:14:29,064 --> 00:14:32,798
Bu yerda oʻtirsak boʻladi-mi?

377
00:14:32,821 --> 00:14:35,054
Hoziridanmi?

378
00:14:35,077 --> 00:14:36,644
Ha.

379
00:14:36,667 --> 00:14:39,243
Biz tugatdik-ku.

380
00:14:39,266 --> 00:14:40,907
Rostdanmi?

381
00:14:40,930 --> 00:14:43,902
Xoʻp, tozalaymiz.

382
00:14:43,926 --> 00:14:45,893
Rahmat.

383
00:14:45,916 --> 00:14:48,482
Keyin yigʻilishmi?

384
00:14:48,505 --> 00:14:50,772
Ha, shunday.

385
00:14:50,796 --> 00:14:52,596
Necha kishi?

386
00:14:52,619 --> 00:14:54,619
Besh kishi.

387
00:14:54,642 --> 00:14:56,975
Stullar yetadimi?

388
00:14:56,998 --> 00:14:59,077
Ehtimol, yetadi.

389
00:14:59,101 --> 00:15:01,635
Oq doska ishlatamizmi?

390
00:15:01,658 --> 00:15:03,858
Ha, ishlatamiz.

391
00:15:03,880 --> 00:15:05,916
Oʻchirib qoʻyaman.

392
00:15:05,939 --> 00:15:07,946
Kechirasiz.

393
00:15:07,970 --> 00:15:11,503
Proyektor ham ishlatamiz.

394
00:15:11,526 --> 00:15:14,259
Shunday qoldirib qoʻyaman.

395
00:15:14,282 --> 00:15:15,816
Katta yordam boʻldingiz.

396
00:15:15,839 --> 00:15:18,473
Eslab qolgan narsangiz yoʻqmi?

397
00:15:18,496 --> 00:15:21,029
Qalam tushib ketibdi-ku.

398
00:15:21,052 --> 00:15:23,511
A, bu meningniki.

399
00:15:23,535 --> 00:15:25,535
Mana, oling.

400
00:15:25,558 --> 00:15:27,171
Rahmat.

401
00:15:27,194 --> 00:15:29,435
Mehnatingiz uchun rahmat.

402
00:15:29,458 --> 00:15:31,674
Mehnatingiz uchun rahmat.

403
00:15:31,698 --> 00:15:33,198
14-SAHNA: CHIQINDILARNI AJRATISH ASOSLARI

404
00:15:33,198 --> 00:15:34,835
Kechirasiz.

405
00:15:34,858 --> 00:15:36,105
Ha.

406
00:15:36,129 --> 00:15:39,662
Bu shu yerga tashlasam boʻladi-mi?

407
00:15:39,685 --> 00:15:42,119
Plastikmi?

408
00:15:42,143 --> 00:15:43,555
Ha.

409
00:15:43,578 --> 00:15:45,821
Bu yerga iltimos.

410
00:15:45,845 --> 00:15:47,898
Rahmat.

411
00:15:47,921 --> 00:15:50,921
Ajratish qattiq ekan.

412
00:15:50,944 --> 00:15:52,944
Shunday ekan-ku.

413
00:15:52,967 --> 00:15:56,065
Yonuvchi chiqindilar shu tomonda.

414
00:15:56,088 --> 00:15:57,821
Tushunarli.

415
00:15:57,844 --> 00:16:00,819
Qutilar va shishalar tashqarida.

416
00:16:00,842 --> 00:16:02,576
Tashqaridami?

417
00:16:02,599 --> 00:16:03,932
Ha.

418
00:16:03,955 --> 00:16:05,155
Ha.

419
00:16:05,178 --> 00:16:07,752
Har kuni yigʻishtirib turishadimi?

420
00:16:07,776 --> 00:16:11,053
Yoʻq, seshanba va juma kunlari.

421
00:16:11,077 --> 00:16:12,710
Shunday ekan.

422
00:16:12,733 --> 00:16:16,166
Bugun yonuvchi chiqindilar kuni.

423
00:16:16,189 --> 00:16:17,723
Yordam berdingiz, rahmat.

424
00:16:17,746 --> 00:16:20,912
Yaqinda koʻchib kelgansizmi?

425
00:16:20,935 --> 00:16:22,169
Ha.

426
00:16:22,192 --> 00:16:23,841
Oʻtgan hafta.

427
00:16:23,864 --> 00:16:25,630
Shunday ekan.

428
00:16:25,653 --> 00:16:28,420
Hali yaxshi bilmayman.

429
00:16:28,443 --> 00:16:30,843
Har doim soʻrashingiz mumkin.

430
00:16:30,866 --> 00:16:32,833
Rahmat.

431
00:16:32,856 --> 00:16:36,056
Men qoʻshni xonadaman.

432
00:16:36,079 --> 00:16:38,649
A, iltimos, yaxshi koʻraman.

433
00:16:38,673 --> 00:16:40,510
Men ham.

434
00:16:40,533 --> 00:16:42,700
Endi ketaman.

435
00:16:42,723 --> 00:16:44,141
Ha.

436
00:16:44,165 --> 00:16:45,665
15-SAHNA: SHIRINLIKLARNING MAZASINI ULASHTIRISH

437
00:16:45,665 --> 00:16:49,398
Bu, juda mazali koʻrinadi-ku.

438
00:16:49,421 --> 00:16:52,488
Juda mazali ekan.

439
00:16:52,511 --> 00:16:54,845
Qanday mazasi?

440
00:16:54,868 --> 00:16:57,468
Qulupnay mazasi.

441
00:16:57,491 --> 00:16:59,892
Yaxshi ekan.

442
00:16:59,915 --> 00:17:01,482
Yemoqchimisiz?

443
00:17:01,505 --> 00:17:04,572
Bir tup olsam boʻladi-mi?

444
00:17:04,595 --> 00:17:06,680
Albatta.

445
00:17:06,703 --> 00:17:08,578
Rahmat.

446
00:17:08,602 --> 00:17:10,968
Qoshiq ishlatasizmi?

447
00:17:10,991 --> 00:17:12,624
Ha.

448
00:17:12,647 --> 00:17:15,292
Mana, oling.

449
00:17:15,316 --> 00:17:17,805
Yeyapman!

450
00:17:17,828 --> 00:17:19,036
Qanday?

451
00:17:19,060 --> 00:17:21,935
Shirin va mazali.

452
00:17:21,958 --> 00:17:23,958
Shunday-ku?

453
00:17:23,981 --> 00:17:26,859
Qayerdan sotib oldingiz?

454
00:17:26,882 --> 00:17:30,060
Vokzal oldidagi tort doʻkonidan.

455
00:17:30,083 --> 00:17:32,125
Yangi doʻkonmi?

456
00:17:32,149 --> 00:17:34,206
Ha, yangi.

457
00:17:34,229 --> 00:17:36,596
Borib koʻrayin.

458
00:17:36,619 --> 00:17:39,452
Tavsiya qilaman.

459
00:17:39,475 --> 00:17:41,761
Shokolad mazasi ham bormi?

460
00:17:41,784 --> 00:17:44,551
Bor deb oʻylayman.

461
00:17:44,574 --> 00:17:47,223
Ertaga sotib olaman.

462
00:17:47,247 --> 00:17:49,733
Birga boramizmi?

463
00:17:49,756 --> 00:17:51,125
Rostdanmi?

464
00:17:51,149 --> 00:17:53,044
Ha.

465
00:17:53,067 --> 00:17:54,875
Juda xursandman.

466
00:17:54,898 --> 00:17:57,732
Juda kutaman.

467
00:17:57,755 --> 00:17:59,255
16-SAHNA: BIRGA UYGA QAYTAMIZ / Birga Uyga Qaytamiz

468
00:17:59,255 --> 00:18:00,890
Uyga ketasanmi?

469
00:18:00,913 --> 00:18:03,846
Ha, ketaman.

470
00:18:03,869 --> 00:18:05,869
Men ham ketaman.

471
00:18:05,892 --> 00:18:07,892
Birga qaytamiz.

472
00:18:07,915 --> 00:18:10,548
Ehtiyot buyumlaringni unutmadingmi?

473
00:18:10,571 --> 00:18:12,338
Xavfsiz.

474
00:18:12,361 --> 00:18:14,294
Unda chiqaylik.

475
00:18:14,317 --> 00:18:17,559
Chiroqni oʻchirsam boʻladi mi?

476
00:18:17,583 --> 00:18:20,416
Hali kimdir bormi?

477
00:18:20,439 --> 00:18:22,439
Bilmadim.

478
00:18:22,462 --> 00:18:24,145
Qarayapman.

479
00:18:24,169 --> 00:18:25,573
Iltimos.

480
00:18:25,596 --> 00:18:27,535
Hech kim yoʻq.

481
00:18:27,558 --> 00:18:29,827
Unda oʻchiraman.

482
00:18:29,851 --> 00:18:32,498
Qorongʻi ekan.

483
00:18:32,521 --> 00:18:34,527
Kalitni qulflaymizmi?

484
00:18:34,551 --> 00:18:37,017
Qoʻriqchi buni qiladi.

485
00:18:37,040 --> 00:18:38,528
Shundaymi?

486
00:18:38,552 --> 00:18:41,163
Qorni och ekan.

487
00:18:41,186 --> 00:18:42,802
Lagʻmon yeymizmi?

488
00:18:42,825 --> 00:18:44,559
Yaxshi.

489
00:18:44,582 --> 00:18:47,115
Yangi doʻkon ochildi.

490
00:18:47,138 --> 00:18:48,905
Vokzal yaqinidami?

491
00:18:48,928 --> 00:18:50,261
Ha.

492
00:18:50,284 --> 00:18:51,917
Borib koʻraylik.

493
00:18:51,940 --> 00:18:53,874
Mazali ekanligi aytiladi.

494
00:18:53,897 --> 00:18:55,630
Tezroq boring.

495
00:18:55,653 --> 00:18:57,268
Shoshilaylik.

496
00:18:57,291 --> 00:18:58,791
17-SAHNA: Yuk Va Yapon Tili Oʻrganish / Yuk va Yapon Tili Oʻrganish

497
00:18:58,791 --> 00:19:00,763
Kechirasiz.

498
00:19:00,787 --> 00:19:02,261
Ha.

499
00:19:02,284 --> 00:19:06,926
Yukimni shu yerga qoʻysam boʻladi mi?

500
00:19:06,950 --> 00:19:08,983
Mana, iltimos.

501
00:19:09,006 --> 00:19:10,839
Rahmat.

502
00:19:10,862 --> 00:19:13,337
Ogʻirdek koʻrinadi.

503
00:19:13,361 --> 00:19:16,761
Ichida koʻp kitoblar bor.

504
00:19:16,784 --> 00:19:18,950
Talabasizmi?

505
00:19:18,973 --> 00:19:21,807
Ha, shunday.

506
00:19:21,830 --> 00:19:24,030
Qiyin ekan.

507
00:19:24,052 --> 00:19:27,086
Imtihon yaqin.

508
00:19:27,109 --> 00:19:29,275
Omadingizni bersin.

509
00:19:29,298 --> 00:19:31,132
Rahmat.

510
00:19:31,156 --> 00:19:33,789
Nima oʻrganasiz?

511
00:19:33,812 --> 00:19:36,246
Yapon tilini.

512
00:19:36,269 --> 00:19:39,669
Yapon tilini yaxshi bilasiz.

513
00:19:39,692 --> 00:19:41,925
Hali koʻp narsa kerak.

514
00:19:41,948 --> 00:19:44,246
Kanji qiyinmi?

515
00:19:44,269 --> 00:19:47,436
Juda qiyin.

516
00:19:47,459 --> 00:19:49,392
Oʻqiy olasizmi?

517
00:19:49,415 --> 00:19:52,111
Biroz oʻqiyman.

518
00:19:52,134 --> 00:19:54,301
Ajoyib chiqibdi!

519
00:19:54,324 --> 00:19:57,257
Koʻproq harakat qilaman.

520
00:19:57,280 --> 00:19:59,414
Sizni qoʻllab-quvvatlayman.

521
00:19:59,437 --> 00:20:01,703
Juda xursand boʻldim.

522
00:20:01,726 --> 00:20:04,260
Yaxshi dam oling.

523
00:20:04,283 --> 00:20:06,116
Ha.

524
00:20:06,139 --> 00:20:07,954
Ehtiyot bo'ling.

525
00:20:07,977 --> 00:20:09,748
Rahmat.

526
00:20:09,772 --> 00:20:11,972
Xayr, ko'rishguncha.

527
00:20:11,995 --> 00:20:13,495
18-Sahna: Telefon odobi / Telefon Etiketi

528
00:20:13,495 --> 00:20:15,343
Allo.

529
00:20:15,366 --> 00:20:18,301
A, hozir gaplashsa bo'ladimi?

530
00:20:18,324 --> 00:20:22,124
Kechirasiz, hozir poyezddaman.

